Q & A

Q: Can Prometheus & Grafana be used without Kubernetes?
A: Yes, but it is best fit for Kubernetes. On VMs, configuration has to be done manually.

Q: Why not just use AI for troubleshooting?
A: AI gives generalized answers. It does not know your specific infrastructure. You need your own knowledge to apply fixes based on your environment.

Q: Why not store logs on the application server itself?
A: It increases machine size and cost. A centralized location is more efficient and scalable.
